    <parameter Alignment="1" Callback="soc.memmap.csButtonCallback" Data="" DialogRefresh="0" DoNotStore="false" Enabled="1" Entries="" EntriesType="" Name="View/Edit Memory Map" SaveValueAsString="false" Storage="" Tag="FPGADesignMemMapButton" ToolTip="Launch the memory map application to view and edit the design memory map." Type="pushbutton" Value="" ValueRange="" ValueType="" Visible="1"/>
